Type: Project
Package: ausavifaunaanalyses
Title: Reproducible Analysis of Australian Bird Communities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = c("Rahil", "Jasminkumar"),
           family = "Amin",
           role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6936-5732"))
Description: Reproducible data processing, landscape analysis, beta-diversity
    modelling, regional-convergence analysis, and joint species-distribution
    modelling for Australian bird communities. The repository provides main,
    sensitivity, and reduced demonstration workflows managed with the targets
    package.
